# Build artifacts
/target/

# Cargo.lock IS committed — this workspace ships a binary.

# Editor / OS noise
*.rs.bk
*.pdb
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# insta (P4) leaves these behind on a failed snapshot review
*.snap.new

# Local agent tooling — third-party agent definitions, not part of this project.
# Remove this line if you decide to vendor them into the public repo.
.claude/

# cargo-mutants scratch. ADR-0008 §9 records an on-demand invocation, and it
# writes here rather than under target/ — so the command the ADR tells you to
# run would otherwise dirty the tree it is measuring.
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
